  "question": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{C}_{6} \\mathrm{H}_{5} \\mathrm{F}^{18}$ is a $\\mathrm{F}^{18}$ radio-isotope labelled organic compound. $\\mathrm{F}^{18}$ decays by positron emission. The product resulting on decay is",
